{"claims": [{"text": "или вообще просто запустить автопилот он строит", "line": 6, "entities": ["Autopilot"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "assert"}, {"text": "> “Я загружаю тебе, чего хочу. Ты даёшь патч. Дальше автопилот/кодекс сам строит часами.”", "line": 44, "entities": ["Codex", "Autopilot"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "assert"}, {"text": "Без этого автопилот стоит и “думает о порядке”, а не строит.", "line": 59, "entities": ["Autopilot"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "negate"}, {"text": "Вот это уже **builder autopilot**.", "line": 157, "entities": ["Autopilot"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "assert"}, {"text": "## “запустить автопилот — и он строит”", "line": 173, "entities": ["Autopilot"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "assert"}, {"text": "Текущий узел — это **не builder-autopilot**, а **governance / continuity / state-canon layer**.", "line": 364, "entities": ["Autopilot"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "negate"}, {"text": "- core/autopilot/state/builder_request_v1.json exists and is valid", "line": 608, "entities": ["Autopilot"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "assert"}, {"text": "- core/autopilot/state/builder_objective_v1.json is emitted", "line": 609, "entities": ["Autopilot"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "assert"}, {"text": "- core/autopilot/reports/w_ap_12_builder_objective_intake_report.json is emitted", "line": 611, "entities": ["Autopilot"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "assert"}, {"text": "Для первой builder-intake волны это чуть широко. Не критично, потому что вы ничего ещё не исполняете, но семантически это уже заявка на будущий заход в MEMORY_WAVE.", "line": 1181, "entities": ["Memory Wave"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "negate"}, {"text": "- core/autopilot/state/builder_request_v1.json exists and is valid", "line": 1276, "entities": ["Autopilot"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "assert"}, {"text": "- core/autopilot/state/builder_objective_v1.json is emitted", "line": 1277, "entities": ["Autopilot"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "assert"}, {"text": "- core/autopilot/reports/w_ap_12_builder_objective_intake_report.json is emitted", "line": 1279, "entities": ["Autopilot"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "assert"}, {"text": "И сама цель канонизирована как надо: `builder_objective_v1.json` помечен `INTAKE_CANONICALIZED`, `initiated_from = W_AP_11`, `bounded = true`, `lawful = true`, `immutable = true`, а `target_paths` узко ограничены до `core/autopilot/**`. Это очень хороший builder-entry, без widening.", "line": 1888, "entities": ["Autopilot"], "intent": "requirement", "polarity": "negate"}, {"text": "- core/autopilot/state/wave_synthesis_v1.json is emitted", "line": 1977, "entities": ["Autopilot"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "assert"}, {"text": "- core/autopilot/state/atom_plan_v1.json is emitted", "line": 1978, "entities": ["Autopilot"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "assert"}, {"text": "- core/autopilot/reports/w_ap_13_wave_synthesis_report.json is emitted", "line": 1981, "entities": ["Autopilot"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "assert"}, {"text": "\"no MEMORY_WAVE mutation path is admitted\"", "line": 2182, "entities": ["Memory Wave"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "negate"}, {"text": "никакого patch execution не было, lineage `W_AP_10/W_AP_11/W_AP_12` не мутировался, `MEMORY_WAVE` не трогался, автономный continuation loop не запускался. То есть это именно **чистый bounded synthesis step**.", "line": 2628, "entities": ["Memory Wave"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "negate"}, {"text": "- core/autopilot/state/primitive_schema_v1.json is emitted", "line": 2716, "entities": ["Autopilot"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "assert"}, {"text": "- core/autopilot/state/primitive_registry_seed_v1.json is emitted", "line": 2717, "entities": ["Autopilot"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "assert"}, {"text": "- core/autopilot/state/primitive_validation_surface_v1.json is emitted", "line": 2718, "entities": ["Autopilot"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "assert"}, {"text": "- core/autopilot/reports/w_ap_14_execution_primitive_library_report.json is emitted", "line": 2720, "entities": ["Autopilot"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "assert"}, {"text": "И главное — это уже не “разговоры про автопилот”, а реальная собранная builder-цепь.", "line": 3484, "entities": ["Autopilot"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "negate"}, {"text": "- core/autopilot/state/build_chronicle_v1.json is emitted", "line": 3618, "entities": ["Autopilot"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "assert"}, {"text": "- core/autopilot/state/build_cycle_cursor_v1.json is emitted", "line": 3619, "entities": ["Autopilot"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "assert"}, {"text": "- core/autopilot/state/build_chronicle_surface_v1.json is emitted", "line": 3620, "entities": ["Autopilot"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "assert"}, {"text": "- core/autopilot/reports/w_ap_15_build_chronicle_report.json is emitted", "line": 3622, "entities": ["Autopilot"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "assert"}, {"text": "- core/autopilot/state/builder_patch_plan_v1.json is emitted", "line": 4437, "entities": ["Autopilot"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "assert"}, {"text": "- core/autopilot/state/builder_patch_plan_surface_v1.json is emitted", "line": 4438, "entities": ["Autopilot"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "assert"}, {"text": "- core/autopilot/state/builder_patch_plan_validation_v1.json is emitted", "line": 4439, "entities": ["Autopilot"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "assert"}, {"text": "- core/autopilot/reports/w_ap_16_patch_plan_compiler_report.json is emitted", "line": 4441, "entities": ["Autopilot"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "assert"}, {"text": "- core/autopilot/runtime/single_cycle_builder_autoplay_engine.py is emitted", "line": 5398, "entities": ["Autopilot"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "assert"}, {"text": "- core/autopilot/state/builder_